 "structural_change": "STRUCTURAL qkd_kvs_ctl_c32a (KV-CTL10 10-20, K.STA.CTL exact successor): the die binds the boot-ages tile qkd_kvs_ctl (62 ports, kv_static_die OT_KV_MU=1 OT_KV_BOOT_AGES=1); mu2 / s32a/b were refused by kv_tile_views (tile RTL differs: 45 ports, no age outputs, o_attn 77 b). This kit = the die generator with OT_KV_CTL_C32=1 (tools/qwen_kv_die/kv_ctl_c32.py): SAME 62 ports / wiring / assigns, members = the KV-CTL3 native32 successors (b5d750822) + qkd_kv_die_cfg_a_c32 (boot-age words, census form) + qkd_kv_ownership_obs_c32; CTLSRAM 1. Pin registers OFF (die charges 0 tile pin edges; owner 10-20 09:05), reset landing 2 stages.",
